<title>USA: ICF Kaiser sets buyback up to $1.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>ICF Kaiser sets buyback up to $1.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICF Kaiser International Inc said on Friday it would repurchase up to $1.5 million shares of the its common stock.</p>
<p>ICF Kaiser, a Fairfax, Virginia-based engineering, construction and consulting services company said that the company's common stock at current prices is under-valued.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
